格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH plugin: replaces the kernel boot page with a full-window video clip, then dissolves into the app. 中文说明见 MANUAL.md","id":"gh:1416844509","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-boot-animation","slug":"Alice-Marx/dsh-boot-animation","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH plugin: replaces the kernel boot page with a full-window video clip, then dissolves into the app"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ces the kernel boot page with a full-window video clip, then dissolves into the app. 中文说明见 MANUAL.md"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-boot-animation"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Replaces the DSH startup page with a chosen or random local video, or with a data-driven boot-screen"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" template (scene steps, a keyframed timeline, or a whole iframe document), then transitions into the"},{"id":"p3s3","text":" app, with configurable playback and fallback controls. It does not modify DSH core source; future c"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"ompatibility is not guaranteed."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**Language:** English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"This is a community plugin, not affiliated with or endorsed by DeepSeek."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Package:** `@ljwei-stak/dsh-boot-animation`\n- **Release:** 0.6.2\n- **Repository:** Alice-Marx/ds"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"h-boot-animation\n- **Topic:** `dsh-plugin`\n- **Directory category:** UI & Experience (用户界面与体验), foll"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"owing the DSH Plugin Hub submission categories. A category choice is not a claim of listing acceptan"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"ng the DSH Plugin Hub submission categories. A category choice is not a claim of listing acceptance."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Local Chromium demo host rendering the actual 0.6.2 boot and card source with sample profile data. T"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"hese are not screenshots of a signed-in live DSH profile and are not a cross-platform certification."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The clip form: a full-window clip, the progress bar following the real boot, and the hint line."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The template form: the built-in `archive-warm` steps template — the classic\nauthorisation sequence, "},{"id":"p10s2","text":"waiting for the operator's confirmation."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Web"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Host and Node requirements must already be met."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### Desktop"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Open **Settings -> Plugins -> Add plugin**, paste `@ljwei-stak/dsh-boot-animation@0.6.2`, then quit "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"and reopen from the tray as prompted."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"For Desktop upgrades where the live install API reports the package as already installed, fully quit"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" from the tray first and use the official Desktop bundled wrapper — not an older global `dsh` binary"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"from the tray first and use the official Desktop bundled wrapper — not an older global `dsh` binary."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Windows default-location copyable offline command:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Adjust the wrapper path if DeepSeek Harness is installed elsewhere. If you use a custom `DSH_HOME`, "},{"id":"p20s2","text":"retain it when running this command. Do not use this exact Windows path on Linux or macOS."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Uninstall"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Web:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Desktop: use the official plugin UI. Existing custom videos are separate data; review and back them "},{"id":"p24s2","text":"up before manual deletion. A fresh package install auto-registers the scoped bundle; do not manually"},{"id":"p24s3","text":" insert a second bundle entry."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The plugin uses the host profile configuration and a plugin patch file. There is no separate `.env`,"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" INI, or JSON settings loader."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| File | Role |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| `<DSH_HOME>/profiles/<profile>/cordis.yml` | Host base configuration. |\n| `<DSH_HOME>/profiles/<pr"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ofile>/cordis.patch.yml` | Plugin configuration edits. The shipped patch mounts id `boot-animation` "},{"id":"p28s3","text":"with name `@ljwei-stak/dsh-boot-animation`. |\n| Profile `package.json` | Tracks dependency and `dsh."},{"id":"p28s4","text":"profile.bundles` via the installer. |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"An example fragment is provided as a config-object reference only; it is not a standalone autoloaded"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"agment is provided as a config-object reference only; it is not a standalone autoloaded config file."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Settings namespace: `boot-animation`. Prefer the existing settings UI. Preview uses current settings"},{"id":"p30s2","text":" immediately. Reload the Web page for the next startup; on Desktop, fully quit from the tray and reo"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"pen for the next startup. Host entry upgrades also require a full process restart."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Key | Default | Notes |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| `enabled` | `true` | Master switch. |\n| `fadeMs` | `2000` | Schema range `300`–`5000` ms; UI prese"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"ts `1000`, `1500`, `2000`, `3000`, `4000`. |\n| `enterMode` | `tail` | `tail` dissolves at clip end; "},{"id":"p32s3","text":"`end` fades after playback; `click` loops until entry. |\n| `disabledClips` | `[]` | Opaque filenames"},{"id":"p32s4","text":" disabled in the pool. |\n| `sound` | `true` | Subject to browser gesture policy. |\n| `clickToEnter` "},{"id":"p32s5","text":"| `false` | When enabled, the first pointer press enters immediately; otherwise a press may first un"},{"id":"p32s6","text":"lock audio. |\n| `showHint` | `true` | Display entry hint. |\n| `form` | `video` | `video` is the clip"},{"id":"p32s7","text":" screen; `template` hands the boot page to the data-driven runtime. |\n| `template` | `archive-warm` "},{"id":"p32s8","text":"| Template id for the template form's first act. |\n| `template2` | `\"\"` | Optional second act; empty"},{"id":"p32s9","text":" plays none. |\n| `tpl` | see below | The template form's own settings (speed, theme, mode, voice, id"},{"id":"p32s10","text":"entity, colours, transitions, glass). |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"`tpl` is one nested object whose leaves are individually live-editable — the\nsettings card writes on"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"e leaf at a time (`{ op: 'set', path: ['tpl', 'speed'] }`).\nEvery field the Host does not send keeps"},{"id":"p33s3","text":" the vendored runtime's own default, so a\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Media"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Imported videos are copied to `<DSH_HOME>/profiles/<profile>/data/dsh-boot-animation/videos`. The or"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"iginal selected file is untouched. Legacy bundled assets under `assets/videos` may be replaced by pa"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"ckage upgrades; UI import is preferred."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"In the UI, open **Settings -> Plugins -> Installed plugins -> 启动动画** — the configuration section is "},{"id":"p36s2","text":"on the plugin's own page, and each row's configure page shows the same card. On DSH 0.2.1 and older "},{"id":"p36s3","text":"the card lives in the “插件配置” list instead. There you can import a video up to 256 MiB, set one clip "},{"id":"p36s4","text":"as startup or enable several for random selection, preview current effects, and remove custom clips "},{"id":"p36s5","text":"e several for random selection, preview current effects, and remove custom clips after confirmation."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"- **DSH:** minimum `>=0.2.0-rc.2`; integration verified against Windows Desktop runtime `0.2.0-rc.2`"},{"id":"p38s2","text":" and `0.2.1-rc.2`.\n- **Node:** `^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0`; ESM.\n- **Runtime dependency:** `@deepseek-ai/"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"schemastery` `^3.18.4` (declared as a dependency, not a peer dependency).\n- **Browsers:** Chromium, "},{"id":"p38s4","text":"Chrome, and Edge targeted; Firefox is unverified.\n- **Platforms:** macOS and Linux script paths exis"},{"id":"p38s5","text":"t but were not independently tested in this acceptance.\n- **Codecs:** browser-supported codecs are r"},{"id":"p38s6","text":"equired. H.264/AAC MP4 is preferred. MP4, WebM, M4V, and MOV containers do not guarantee codec decod"},{"id":"p38s7","text":"red. H.264/AAC MP4 is preferred. MP4, WebM, M4V, and MOV containers do not guarantee codec decoding."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
